# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# article, demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# verão: 3rd person plural future indicative of "ver" (Wiktionary "verão",
# Portuguese, verb form). The season takes an article or a preposition: "o
# verão", "no verão", "de verão".
verão
